            <span style="font-size:11.5px;font-weight:600;color:#EC4899;background:rgba(236,72,153,0.15);padding:2px 8px;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid rgba(236,72,153,0.4);">🎯 目标 ${targetScore}分</span>
            <button data-xxl-act="xxl-quit" style="background:none;border:none;font-size:20px;cursor:pointer;color:var(--ubp-text);" title="结束本局并返回游戏中心（不保存进度）">✕</button>
